<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36358" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pinguĭtūdo</span></b> ,
			ĭnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>fatness</i>, <i>richness</i>, <i>coarseness</i>, <i>rankness.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: vere sus usque adeo pinguitudine
			crescere solet, ut, etc., Cato ap. <i><span class="en">Varr. R.
				R. 2, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 4, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 11,
				37, 71, § 186</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 12, 52, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">soli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 24, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 3, 12, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>broadness</i>, <i>coarseness</i> of pronunciation, opp. to exilitas,
				<i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 11, 4</span></i> (v. l.
		pinguedine).</div>
